OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRain across
OL,6,Fmuch of the north, though turning
OL,7,Fmostly dry for the far north of
OL,8,FScotland. Scattered, sometimes heavy
OL,9,Fshowers continue in the south. Winds
OL,10,Feasing, but remaining strong along
OL,11,Fsouthern coasts.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FBright in northern
OL,14,FScotland, but cold with patchy rain
OL,15,Felsewhere across the north. Milder
OL,16,Fwith sunny spells and scattered heavy
OL,17,Fand blustery showers in the south,
OL,18,Fthese locally thundery.
